  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.nottobla.me/resource-packs/customoutline/assets/banner.png\" alt=\"自定义轮廓横幅\"></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-0C0D0F?logo=github&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fNotToBlame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--Fi-0C0D0F?logo=kofi&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://twitch.tv/NotToBlame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitch-0C0D0F?logo=twitch&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持-0C0D0F?logo=discord&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"支持 Discord\"></a></p><p>这个资源包允许你完全自定义《我的世界》中的方块轮廓颜色，为游戏赋予个性化视觉风格。<br>\n默认提供颜色值为 <code>#ffcc0080</code> <img src=\"https://www.nottobla.me/resource-packs/customoutline/assets/color.png\" alt=\"默认颜色样本\"></p><h2>自定义轮廓</h2><p>有两种方式设置轮廓颜色：</p><h3>1. 手动修改</h3><p>直接编辑以下文件：<br>\n<code>assets/minecraft/shaders/core/rendertype_lines.vsh</code></p><p>修改这行代码：<br>\n<code>temp = vec4(1.0, 0.8, 0.0, 0.5); // RGBA</code><br>\n替换为你想要的RGBA值。</p><h3>2. 网页生成器</h3><p>使用定制生成器创建指定颜色的资源包。支持滑块调色、HEX输入、预设方案，并可保存自定义配置。</p><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.nottobla.me%252fresource-packs%252fcustomoutline%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">打开轮廓颜色生成器</a></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.nottobla.me%252fresource-packs%252fcustomoutline%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.nottobla.me/resource-packs/customoutline/assets/webprev.png\" alt=\"网页生成器预览\"></a></p><h2>⚠️ 兼容性说明</h2><p>与光影包（如Iris、Optifine）不兼容，因为它们会覆盖核心着色器。</p><p>如需在使用光影时保留自定义轮廓，请选用支持轮廓定制的光影包：<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Reimagined</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Unbound</a><br>\n或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fphoton-shader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Photon Shader</a></p><p>需要帮助或有建议？<br>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入Discord频道</a>。</p><h2><strong>许可协议</strong></h2><p>🎨 自定义轮廓资源包 © NotToBlame 版权所有。允许：</p><ul>\n<li>✅ 在整合包中使用<strong>（需通过官方渠道下载：Modrinth/CurseForge）</strong></li>\n<li>✅ 制作并发布<strong>附加资源包</strong>（不得包含原始文件）</li>\n<li>✅ 进行<strong>个人修改</strong>（禁止二次分发）</li>\n</ul><p>禁止行为：</p><ul>\n<li>❌ 重新上传或分发本资源包及其素材</li>\n<li>❌ 在你发布的文件中包含原始资源</li>\n<li>❌ 未经许可将本资源包用于商业用途</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.nottobla.me%252fassets%252flicense.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看完整许可协议 →</a></p>",
